P3para.Text:
in the definition of  “cosmetic product” in regulation 2, for  “regulation 3 of the Cosmetic Products (Safety) Regulations 2004” substitute “
                  Article 2 of Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009 of the European Parliament and of the Council on cosmetic products (recast) as amended from time to time
                ”;

in regulation 5(7) for  “regulation 7(2)(a) of the Cosmetic Products (Safety) Regulations 2004 requires a package to be marked with information about the manufacturer or supplier established in a member State” substitute “
                  Article 19 of Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009 of the European Parliament and of the Council on cosmetic products (recast), as amended from time to time, requires a package to bear information about the responsible person, as defined in Article 4 of that Regulation
                ”;

insert “
                  Cosmetic Products Enforcement Regulations 2012
                ” in the appropriate place;

in Regulation 2 in the definition of  “cosmetic product” for  “regulation 3 of the Cosmetic Products (Safety) Regulations 2008” substitute “
                  Article 2 of Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009 of the European Parliament and of the Council on cosmetic products (recast) as amended from time to time
                ”;

in Regulation 5(7) for  “Where regulation 12(1)(a) of the Cosmetic Products (Safety) Regulations 2008 requires a package to be marked with information about the manufacturer or supplier established in a member State” substitute “
                  Where Article 19 of Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009 of the European Parliament and of the Council on cosmetic products (recast)  requires a package to bear information about the responsible person, as defined in Article 4 of that Regulation
                ”;
